{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>COLLAR成員Gao與美女廚師Kit Mak在ViuTV節目《港出好味道》第7集，遠赴英國拜訪3位開設冰鮮湯 …</p><p></p>\n<p>COLLAR成員Gao與美女廚師Kit Mak在ViuTV節目《港出好味道》第7集，遠赴英國拜訪3位開設冰鮮湯麵工廠的移英港人。3位老闆初期面臨物流配送延誤及繁複工序等嚴峻挑戰，幾乎令整盤生意陷入絕境。他們最終憑藉破格的自營物流與全人手製作，逆轉了這個看似無解的難關。之後Kit和Gao更會合Ivy，到「曼城葵廣」掃街，Gao與Ivy大啖港人燒味店的招牌燒鵝髀！</p>\n<h2>《港出好味道》Gao與Kit赴英國工廠遇震撼畫面</h2>\n<p>節目中Gao與Kit親身走入這間位於英國Warrington的食品工廠，直擊3人全人手處理湯底及麵條包裝的生產流程。2位主持獲安排即場自選湯底與配料，Kit貪心加料更被店主笑指湯麵似盆菜，場面相當震撼。Gao在簡單翻熱品嚐後，大讚食物質素極高。</p>\n<h2>創辦人Herbert親述逆境求生全人手製作保證品質</h2>\n<p>面對創業初期的種種難關，創辦人之一Herbert在受訪時道出決心：「我們開始之前都知道會有這段時間需要經歷。」工廠曾遇上物流配送不穩定導致食材保鮮期受影響，甚至試過運送延誤超過10小時。3人其後決定改由自行車隊配送解決保鮮危機，並堅持採用全人手製作以確保每碗湯麵品質一致，成功令產品打入英國當地超級市場及農場商店。</p>\n<h2>3位移英港人因相同價值觀合作創業</h2>\n<p>Herbert、Anson和Michael這3位飲食業門外漢原本在香港只有1次相遇的緣份，當時僅在同住大廈偶然遇見並談論過單車話題。直至移居英國後，他們發覺彼此在人生目標及家庭觀念上擁有極度相近的標準，於是一拍即合決定合夥創業。由初期只生產肉丸，慢慢改良至推出包含湯底與配料並方便快捷的翻熱包裝，最終成功研發出多款切合不同顧客口味的冰鮮湯麵。之後Kit和Gao更會合Ivy，到「曼城葵廣」掃街。老闆們見到三人到來，即場斬燒鵝髀給她們試食。Gao與Ivy試完都忍不住手舞足蹈：「好好味啊！好開心啊！」並表示回到香港一定會再去位於元朗的分店！</p>\n<h2>觀眾激讚Gao與Ivy豪邁食相 力撐港人拼搏精神</h2>\n<p>節目播出後引發大批網民熱烈討論，不少觀眾對於3位老闆在異鄉堅持不懈大感敬佩。有網民在社交平台留言表示：「這幾位老闆展現出真正的香港人拼搏精神！」亦有大批粉絲將焦點放在主持身上，直指Gao與Ivy試食時興奮到跳舞的反應極度可愛，紛紛於各大討論區留下正面評價。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433898832118752_11830702576af370acd26a8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao和Kit即場自選湯底與豐富配料，Kit貪心加料被笑指湯麵似盆菜。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433898832118752_11830702576af370acd26a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao和Kit即場自選湯底與豐富配料，Kit貪心加料被笑指湯麵似盆菜。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389903462274_5066151576af370aeda9fe.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar 3位老闆原本在香港僅有一面之緣因單車話題結緣，移居英國後一拍即合創業。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389903462274_5066151576af370aeda9fe.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>3位老闆原本在香港僅有一面之緣因單車話題結緣，移居英國後一拍即合創業。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389965608358_1949342926af370b4eb438.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Ivy前往曼城葵廣掃街，即場品嚐燒鵝髀。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943389965608358_1949342926af370b4eb438.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy前往曼城葵廣掃街，即場品嚐燒鵝髀。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900328917930_7284207086af370bbaa529.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Gao大讚好味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900328917930_7284207086af370bbaa529.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Gao大讚好味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900959540851_10671443106af370c21e33d.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Ivy和Gao曼城葵廣掃街，大讚質素極高，完美還原正宗香港風味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433900959540851_10671443106af370c21e33d.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Ivy和Gao曼城葵廣掃街，大讚質素極高，完美還原正宗香港風味。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901615124181_11853250006af370c884041.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar COLLAR成員Gao與Kit遠赴英國Warrington，親身拜訪開設冰鮮湯麵工廠的移英港人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901615124181_11853250006af370c884041.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>COLLAR成員Gao與Kit遠赴英國Warrington，親身拜訪開設冰鮮湯麵工廠的移英港人。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901796694772_6526630466af370ca4db65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar 工廠內部直擊3人全人手處理湯底及麵條包裝，確保產品品質與口感。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901796694772_6526630466af370ca4db65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>工廠內部直擊3人全人手處理湯底及麵條包裝，確保產品品質與口感。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901948929219_4761418916af370cc7bb34.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"港出好味道 collar Kit、Ivy和Gao大啖出爐燒鵝髀，大飽口福。（圖片來源：ViuTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179433901948929219_4761418916af370cc7bb34.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Kit、Ivy和Gao大啖出爐燒鵝髀，大飽口福。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/collar/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">COLLAR</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%86%b0%e9%ae%ae%e6%b9%af%e9%ba%b5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">冰鮮湯麵</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%b8%af%e5%87%ba%e5%a5%bd%e5%91%b3%e9%81%93/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">港出好味道</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：ViuTV資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3540032\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 11 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T21:07:08.027397+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1676,"images":8,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T19:30:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T23:22:25.578767+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T21:00:41.169168+00:00","content_hash":"f621ea5a65deabc8ddbe46d527ccab4b4a96f6eba7c51524a39ed5d2660a5573","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}